  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Buen Gobierno</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Local Governance Solutions Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyar v&#xed;as para una participaci&#xf3;n y supervisi&#xf3;n p&#xfa;blicas significativas, as&#xed; como para una separaci&#xf3;n sustantiva de poderes a trav&#xe9;s de controles y equilibrios institucionales. La transparencia y la integridad tambi&#xe9;n son vitales para la eficacia del gobierno y la estabilidad pol&#xed;tica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The USAID Local Governance Solutions Project has three key pillars:Making citizens a focal point in the local governance ecosystem; supporting a demonstrative effect by recapturing citizens trust and confidence in municipal governments; and adopting a politically aware perspective that considers actors and institutions incentives and motivations.</narrative>
  </description>
